gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Congress has sought 120 seats in the upcoming Uttar Pradesh assembly elections and is unwilling to accept fewer, news agency ANI reported, citing party sources. Its wish list includes constituencies in Amethi and Raebareli, traditional Gandhi family strongholds, as well as two seats in Saharanpur where the SP has announced candidates. The demand has complicated seat-sharing talks between the INDIA bloc allies.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/120-seats-and-gandhi-family-turf-why-amethi-raebareli-are-testing-congress-sp-ties/articleshow/136149081.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/120-seats-and-gandhi-family-turf-why-amethi-raebareli-are-testing-congress-sp-ties/articleshow/136149081.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-25T11:33:58+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Abhishek Mishra</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136150209,imgsize-1065654.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Reel blocked, visa cancelled': Dhruv Rathee hits out at Centre after Saurav Das denied flight to London]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/reel-blocked-visa-cancelled-dhruv-rathee-hits-out-at-centre-after-saurav-das-denied-flight-to-london/articleshow/136148941.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136148941.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/reel-blocked-visa-cancelled-dhruv-rathee-hits-out-at-centre-after-saurav-das-denied-flight-to-london/articleshow/136148941.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/reel-blocked-visa-cancelled-dhruv-rathee-hits-out-at-centre-after-saurav-das-denied-flight-to-london/articleshow/136148941.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-25T11:33:26+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Prisha Patnaik</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136150160,imgsize-979300.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[‘Lamp could not be lit at designated spot’: Tamil Nadu govt apologises in Supreme Court, contempt plea to be heard in Karthigai Deepam row]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/lamp-could-not-be-lit-at-designated-spot-sc-agrees-to-hear-contempt-plea-over-deepam-row/articleshow/136149538.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136149538.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/lamp-could-not-be-lit-at-designated-spot-sc-agrees-to-hear-contempt-plea-over-deepam-row/articleshow/136149538.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/lamp-could-not-be-lit-at-designated-spot-sc-agrees-to-hear-contempt-plea-over-deepam-row/articleshow/136149538.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-25T11:20:51+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Ayush Pandey</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136149768,imgsize-124839.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Congress to hold nationwide ‘Samvidhan Raksha’ marches on Thursday; Kharge to lead from Lucknow]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/congress-to-hold-nationwide-samvidhan-raksha-marches-on-thursday-kharge-to-lead-from-lucknow/articleshow/136149541.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136149541.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Congress is set to hold 'Samvidhan Raksha' Marches on Thursday to honor Constitution Day. Party President Mallikarjun Kharge will join the event in Lucknow. Each Pradesh Congress Committee will begin the marches at notable statues of BR Ambedkar or Mahatma Gandhi. Additionally, party workers will verify voter lists and assist with electoral rights reclamation. Concerns have been raised about alleged irregularities in electoral rolls and the electoral process.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/congress-to-hold-nationwide-samvidhan-raksha-marches-on-thursday-kharge-to-lead-from-lucknow/articleshow/136149541.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/congress-to-hold-nationwide-samvidhan-raksha-marches-on-thursday-kharge-to-lead-from-lucknow/articleshow/136149541.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-25T11:14:40+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Pranjal Pandey</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136149667,imgsize-144324.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[‘Are we beggars?’ Congress fumes as Akhilesh offers 26 seats for UP polls]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/are-we-beggars-congress-fumes-as-akhilesh-offers-26-seats-for-up-polls/articleshow/136148229.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136148229.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Tensions have surfaced between the Samajwadi Party and Congress ahead of the 2027 Uttar Pradesh Assembly elections, with Congress MP Imran Masood asking, "Are we beggars?" over SP's offer of 26 seats. While Congress is seeking 120 seats, Akhilesh Yadav has stressed winnability and called for further discussions to defeat the BJP.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/are-we-beggars-congress-fumes-as-akhilesh-offers-26-seats-for-up-polls/articleshow/136148229.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/are-we-beggars-congress-fumes-as-akhilesh-offers-26-seats-for-up-polls/articleshow/136148229.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-25T10:21:20+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Abhishek Mishra</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136148397,imgsize-990600.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[‘Crores of devotees let down’: BJP slams Vijay govt for defying SC order on Deepam row]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/crores-of-devotees-let-down-bjp-slams-vijay-govt-for-defying-sc-order-on-deepam-row/articleshow/136147315.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136147315.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/crores-of-devotees-let-down-bjp-slams-vijay-govt-for-defying-sc-order-on-deepam-row/articleshow/136147315.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/crores-of-devotees-let-down-bjp-slams-vijay-govt-for-defying-sc-order-on-deepam-row/articleshow/136147315.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-25T10:19:33+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Ayush Pandey</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136148338,imgsize-41286.cms"/></item></channel></rss>